              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alimu Ekapolon atemar, apaki ŋin, elemunio analyalin ŋakoyo a ŋirwosi a Yudaya, ŋakoyo a ŋikapolok, ŋakoyo a ŋisacaradotin, ŋakoyo a ŋikadwarak ka ŋakoyo a ŋituŋa a ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido elokinio ikes nakoloŋ, lolap ka losubuna ŋulu alokidiama daadaŋ ŋulu sek apotu ikes tominakis ka kitiyanakis, ŋulu apotu ikes kiwuapa ka kiŋita ŋakiro, ido kilipa neni kec, nyecunakinio ikes iwapei tonukae, ikwaanikinosi ikes ka aoret ipetipetakina kwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iitanete anakiboisyo a daadaŋ a ŋuna erita ayoŋ ikes ŋipiya a ŋituŋa a ŋulu aronok a lu atwanare, akilo akiyar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asecit ka Akisicanio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kigwor ekadwaran aŋuna a ŋituŋa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
